@* WI #9133 — what connecting Plaud does (spec §6.1, D1: short and factual). WI #9680: OrgModuleName is
   "Fortress FIRM" for FIRM and "Refuge Notetaker" for RN (BrandingConfig). *@
@inject BrandingConfig Branding

<MudStack Spacing="1">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">
        Connect your own Plaud account. @Branding.OrgModuleName downloads the audio of your Plaud recordings and
        processes it like your other meetings: transcript, speaker names, summary, and your knowledge-base settings.
    </MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
        @Branding.ModuleName never changes anything in Plaud. Recordings must be synced to the Plaud cloud.
    </MudText>
</MudStack>
